# Build artifacts NEVER enter git history.
#
# A ~5 MB binary committed monthly is permanent repository bloat (git keeps
# every version forever), and Git LFS — the usual reflex — has a hard 1 GB free
# quota with metered bandwidth. Releases have neither limit and cost nothing.
# This file is the single thing standing between "free forever" and a bill.
build/
*.sqlite
*.sqlite.gz
*.osm.pbf
*.geojson
*.csv
.DS_Store
